  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_14d89a52-a18b-490b-8b1d-6de10494364d.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎來自 Omneria 的訪客，體驗全新的近身格鬥風格</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_704e6194-67b3-43a0-9910-e8b7a123489c.png\" width=\"312\" height=\"54\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_3c9be802-06de-4c00-8239-755a72ae7bcc.png\" width=\"573\" height=\"39\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_e04e5597-7164-47cb-810e-4d5408e038b0.png\" width=\"237\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">侍從：一種以傭兵技術為核心的戰鬥風格，專注於劍、匕首、弓以及騎兵技能。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">新兵：一種側重軍事技術的戰鬥風格，如長矛、弩、盾牌，以及穿戴盔甲以抵禦攻擊。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">熟練工：一種基於平民與戰士技術的戰鬥風格，使用斧頭等重型武器，甚至徒手格鬥。反覆使用重型武器會使這些人變得極為強悍且體魄強健。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_e1ea4cc5-8a23-4d98-b590-55084bd352a2.png\" width=\"378\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">浪人：一種專注於日本武器的戰鬥風格，強調透過爆發速度來造成高傷害。擁有高速、高威力的太刀與打刀攻擊。但防禦相當脆弱。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_897013ed-3151-40b9-90c6-b6fd03d2d387.png\" width=\"423\" height=\"54\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iBWSME0.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"226\" height=\"80\"></span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/battle-arts-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_d58b1e6f-ab3a-408c-b16c-83da548cf9b6.png\" width=\"363\" height=\"48\"></a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_b90c8db2-ce11-4ba6-95e1-c68814e3cc1f.png\" width=\"405\" height=\"54\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">歡迎自由為《Battle Arts》貢獻。所有動畫與視覺作品將獲得適當署名，並具備必要的授權。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">原始碼已開放於 GitHub。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_c9e33640-0910-4568-a9c9-3b2bde698df3.png\" width=\"292\" height=\"54\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_b99e0147-15ac-4e2b-a625-a6ef8b15e67f.png\" width=\"285\" height=\"38\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/MIT_Logo_New.svg/1200px-MIT_Logo_New.svg.png\" alt=\"MIT License - Wikipedia\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_e37ef5c9-b72f-469c-81f1-f1da5e374bc0.png\" width=\"166\" height=\"38\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://mirrors.creativecommons.org/presskit/buttons/88x31/png/by-sa.png\" alt=\"About CC Licenses - Creative Commons\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_faf5fa93-71e3-4ba7-8f31-1bb995cd8175.png\" width=\"436\" height=\"54\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/maninthe_home/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_b93dde18-07c6-4715-b7a9-9a067de89249.png\" width=\"176\" height=\"48\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/littleunicron/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_27d50064-0751-444c-a323-a90985cefc77.png\" width=\"339\" height=\"48\"></a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cosmicexc9018/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_c62ab6e4-ab97-43a0-bf9a-4c6e8011910c.png\" width=\"346\" height=\"48\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/reascer/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_8b0a72e0-ebe6-43c3-8f39-0db24987a1c9.png\" width=\"192\" height=\"48\"></a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/p1nero/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_c88c86ef-5dd1-433e-9cb8-f35fa1a35e4c.png\" width=\"229\" height=\"48\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcmod.cn%252fauthor%252f24904.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/933502/description_79861277-7eb5-4cc8-a53c-ff69dac973bd.png\" width=\"189\" height=\"48\"></a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果您希望提供財務支持以讓我繼續創作內容，您可以<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/user?u=47045722\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此處</a>進行贊助。</span></span></p>",
